  "notes": "Left-header positions 3 and 6-10 have no diagram label (grey dots); the board-render silkscreen beside them reads NC, used as label. Other board-render silkscreen not transcribed. HSPI names are printed with superscript suffixes (HSPI^CLK, ^D, ^Q, ^CS), written joined. Dark grey Physical PIN numbers placed first in functions; PWM wave symbols and the LED icon on IO0 omitted. Printed notes: En - connect to ground to disable the 3.3V regulator. Battery JST connector unlabeled per pin, skipped."
